            <div xml:id="d420">

                <pb facs="0785" n="657" xml:id="pg657"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.2325/50: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Moore</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-08-23T13:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 23,
                                1928—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 1:44 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>97. I have been requested by the Minister for Foreign Affairs to ask for the good
                    offices of the United States for the formal <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >agrément</hi> from the Government of Chile for Cesar A. Elguera as
                    Ambassador to Chile. As soon as I am informed of the receipt of the Chilean
                    reply, the name will be made public here.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
